=== main.frg
#include <window>
#include <stdio>

``` Your own loop ends by itself when the player clicks the X. ```
int main(){
    window.open(320, 200, "Own loop, X");
    int frames = 0;
    while (!window.shouldClose()) {
        frames++;
    }
    print("the player closed it after {frames} frames");
    return 0;
}
=== window
frames: 60
input: CLOSE:9-9
=== output
